{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f7f3e9; box-sizing: border-box; color: #302c27; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #302c27; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #302c27; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #804331; display: inline-block; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1; margin-right: 6px\"\u003e翻\u003c/span\u003e开一册印在温润棉纸上的书，首字自然放大沉入行间，没有多余弹窗与标签，文字重新回到书页原本的安静。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg\" alt=\"阳光木桌上的摊开书页与咖啡杯\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ede4d4; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #302c27; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e像排一本纸质书那样排长文\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #302c27; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e不塞多余的徽章、不套层层外框，全篇依靠舒展宋体、温和棉纸底色与克制细线建立安静的阅读秩序。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #302c27; font-size: 21px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px 14px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e真正耐读的版式，是让人忘了自己在刷手机。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ede4d4; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 32px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #302c27; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 0; text-align: center; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e适合安静沉浸的书写时刻\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e大号宋体首字下沉，自然引入开篇语境\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e细横线与居中章节建立古典书籍节奏\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e极适合书评、访谈、随笔与文化长文\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #716052; color: #302c27; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e合上书页之前，愿这一段文字留给你片刻宁静。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
